  (text "U11 and U12 provide true reverse-current blocking before their common BOOST_5V output.\nUSB-C has hardware source qualification. Optional J7 accepts regulated4.75-5.25V only.\nNominal protection:1A, OV5.484V; terminal UV turn-on4.488V (falling threshold has IC hysteresis)."
